/E (In this project, we are given a dataset of unlabeled session summaries from a Data Science course. Due to poor organization, the instructor has lost track of which summary belongs to which session. Our task is to recover the original mapping between summaries and sessions, and then build visual and analytical tools that help make sense of the data and enable interaction)
/Pg 18 0 R
