/E (The plot shows distinct clusters, each color representing a different group of summaries. Clear separation suggests that our textual representations \(even with simple embeddings\) capture some inherent structure in the data. Some clusters are very compact, indicating strong similarity within that group. A few inter-cluster overlaps suggest possible semantic similarity or limitations in embedding/model)
